# Where the MechWarrior 2 install lives (MW2.PRJ, MW2.EXE, MW2SHELL.EXE, the
# .MW2 archives, GIDDI/, and the CD image's .CUE/.BIN).
# Relative paths are resolved from port/. Nothing from it is copied into port/.
MW2_ROOT=..
# The decompilation, for golden listings and the editor's source view.
MW2_DECOMPILED=../decompiled
